  "body": "Maybe we should define \"implementation-defined\" as a term to use when it's really up to the implementation. At the same time we can stipulate that unless that phrase is used, implementations have basically no freedom. (Except UI and such I suppose, I guess I need to double check how that's normally handled.)",
